{"seq":6,"slug":"lc0066-plus-one","title":"LeetCode 66 加一","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-array-string/lc0066-plus-one","wordCount":742,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-66-加一\">LeetCode 66 加一</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给定一个由整数组成的非空数组所表示的非负整数，在该数的基础上加一。</p>\n<p>最高位数字存放在数组的首位，数组中每个元素只存储单个数字。</p>\n<p>你可以假设除了整数 0 之外，这个整数不会以零开头。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= digits.length &lt;= 100</code></li>\n<li><code>0 &lt;= digits[i] &lt;= 9</code></li>\n<li>输入的数不含前导零</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：digits = [1,2,3]&#10;输出：[1,2,4]&#10;解释：输入数组表示数字 123，加一后得到 124\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：digits = [1,2,3]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[1,2,4]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：输入数组表示数字 123，加一后得到 124</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：digits = [4,3,2,1]&#10;输出：[4,3,2,2]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：digits = [4,3,2,1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[4,3,2,2]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 3：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：digits = [9]&#10;输出：[1,0]&#10;解释：9 + 1 = 10，需要进位\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：digits = [9]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[1,0]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：9 + 1 = 10，需要进位</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 4：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：digits = [9,9,9]&#10;输出：[1,0,0,0]&#10;解释：999 + 1 = 1000，多次进位且数组长度增加\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：digits = [9,9,9]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[1,0,0,0]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：999 + 1 = 1000，多次进位且数组长度增加</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p>本题的核心难点在于<strong>进位处理</strong>。大多数情况下，我们只需将最后一位加 1 即可，但当末尾出现连续的 9 时，进位会一路传播到高位，甚至可能导致数组长度增加（如 999 → 1000）。</p>\n<p><strong>逆向遍历法</strong>是最直接的方案：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>从数组末尾开始遍历（个位数开始）</li>\n<li>当前位加 1</li>\n<li>如果当前位 &lt; 10，说明没有进位，直接返回</li>\n<li>如果当前位 === 10，将当前位设为 0，继续向高位进位</li>\n<li>如果遍历完所有位仍有进位，说明原数形如 999...9，需要在数组头部插入 1</li>\n</ol>\n<p>实际上可以进一步简化——我们不需要显式维护进位变量。因为每次加的都是 1，所以产生进位的唯一条件是当前位为 9。利用这个特性，算法可以写得更简洁：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>从末位开始，如果当前位 &lt; 9，直接加 1 并返回</li>\n<li>如果当前位 === 9，将其设为 0，继续处理上一位</li>\n<li>如果所有位都是 9，最终创建长度加 1 的新数组，首位为 1</li>\n</ol>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>情况</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>进位次数</th>\n<th>数组长度变化</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>末位非 9</td>\n<td>[1,2,3] → [1,2,4]</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>不变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>末位为 9 但非全 9</td>\n<td>[1,2,9] → [1,3,0]</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>不变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连续 9</td>\n<td>[1,9,9] → [2,0,0]</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>不变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全 9</td>\n<td>[9,9,9] → [1,0,0,0]</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>+1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function plusOne(digits: number[]): number[] {&#10;  for (let i = digits.length - 1; i &gt;= 0; i--) {&#10;    if (digits[i] &lt; 9) {&#10;      digits[i]++;&#10;      return digits;&#10;    }&#10;    digits[i] = 0;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const result = new Array(digits.length + 1).fill(0);&#10;  result[0] = 1;&#10;  return result;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> plusOne</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">digits</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> digits.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">--</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (digits[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 9</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      digits[i]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> digits;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    digits[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(digits.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  result[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个实现利用了一个巧妙的观察：加 1 后产生进位，当且仅当当前位为 9。所以我们只需检查当前位是否为 9：如果不是，直接加 1 返回；如果是，置为 0 并继续向高位传播。</p>\n<p>如果需要处理更通用的&quot;加 k&quot;场景（如面试追问），可以使用显式进位：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function plusK(digits: number[], k: number): number[] {&#10;  let carry = k;&#10;&#10;  for (let i = digits.length - 1; i &gt;= 0; i--) {&#10;    const sum = digits[i] + carry;&#10;    digits[i] = sum % 10;&#10;    carry = Math.floor(sum / 10);&#10;&#10;    if (carry === 0) return digits;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const extra: number[] = [];&#10;  while (carry &gt; 0) {&#10;    extra.unshift(carry % 10);&#10;    carry = Math.floor(carry / 10);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return [...extra, ...digits];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> plusK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">digits</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">k</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> carry </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> digits.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">--</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> digits[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> carry;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    digits[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    carry </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">floor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (carry </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> digits;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> extra</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (carry </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    extra.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">unshift</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(carry </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    carry </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">floor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(carry </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">extra, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">digits];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>值</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>最坏情况遍历所有数位（全 9 的场景）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(1) 或 O(n)</td>\n<td>无进位时原地修改为 O(1)；全 9 时需新建数组为 O(n)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最佳情况</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>末位非 9，直接加 1 返回</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>平均情况下，末位非 9 的概率为 90%，此时时间复杂度为 O(1)。只有全 9 的情况（概率约为 10⁻ⁿ）才需要 O(n) 时间。本题虽然简单，但&quot;从低位到高位的进位传播&quot;是大数加法、大数乘法等高频面试题的核心基础。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 66 加一","id":"leetcode-66-加一"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 35 搜索插入位置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-array-string/lc0035-search-insert-position"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 88 合并两个有序数组","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-array-string/lc0088-merge-sorted-array"}}